    "ands.vision.1": "A stable Islamic governance system at peace with itself and its neighbors, standing with full dignity in the international family.",
    "ands.vision.2": "A tolerant, united, and pluralistic nation that honors its Islamic heritage and the deep-seated aspirations toward participation, justice, and equal rights for all.",
